est:\n- item-18b36293621a: 月季光照 半阴窗台\n- item-1de472d5c51f: 盆栽越冬 朝南阳台\n- item-2008d7b27ed9: 盆栽越冬 通风露台\n- item-327ab77da510: 盆土透气 朝南阳台\n- item-363059bb3cc7: 番茄育苗 通风露台\n- item-4425b4436dc2: 薄荷修剪 朝南阳台\n- item-53294f157aec: 多肉浇水 半阴窗台\n- item-53f94c4f082a: 蓝莓基质 半阴窗台\n- item-545936ea40c6: 草莓授粉 半阴窗台\n- item-584d4349511e: 月季光照 夏季室内\n- item-5e7665c76538: 薄荷修剪 半阴窗台\n\nSo I need to select 20 from the practical care types (操作记录, 条件与原理, 概念速览), avoiding 市场观察 (explicitly excluded) and 专题观察 (cultural content less aligned with practical care focus).\n\nGiven the interest emphasizes home plant care, planting methods, and growth principles, I'll select a balanced set across the 10 topics and across the three practical content types.\n\nLet me select 20 candidates. I want balance across topics. There are 10 topics. Let me pick 2 per topic roughly.\n\nTopics:\n1. 草莓授粉 (strawberry pollination)\n2. 盆土透气 (potting soil aeration)\n3. 香草扦插 (herb cuttings)\n4. 蓝莓基质 (blueberry substrate)\n5. 薄荷修剪 (mint pruning)\n6. 盆栽越冬 (potted overwintering)\n7. 番茄育苗 (tomato seedling)\n8. 多肉浇水 (succulent watering)\n9. 月季光照 (rose lighting)\n10. 黄叶排查 (yellow leaf troubleshooting)\n\nLet me select 2 per topic = 20.\n\nFor each topic, I'll pick a mix of content types. Let me choose:\n\n草莓授粉: \n- item-002280b87be1 (操作记录 半阴窗台)\n- item-4e425694d9db (条件与原理 通风露台)\n\n盆土透气:\n- item-04bde6ad0003 (条件与原理 夏季室内)\n- item-3388cf0e679b (操作记录 夏季室内)\n\n香草扦插:\n- item-160347be1b39 (操作记录 朝南阳台)\n- item-0ee4229d4c27 (概念速览 夏季室内)\n\n蓝莓基质:\n- item-02afa433233c (操作记录 朝南阳台)\n- item-45fb6da94e7d (条件与原理 半阴窗台)\n\n薄荷修剪:\n- item-0203081e5c85 (操作记录 通风露台)\n- item-44d2953a9dd1 (条件与原理 朝南阳台)\n\n盆栽越冬:\n- item-26e02f642b93 (操作记录 朝南阳台)\n- item-1cb3d12a82fc (条件与原理 通风露台)\n\n番茄育苗:\n- item-309258e8bc8e (操作记录 朝南阳台)\n- item-53be14d6d282 (条件与原理 通风露台)\n\n多肉浇水:\n- item-096aa2f3c184 (操作记录 夏季室内)\n- item-0ee7c59bda70 (条件与原理 半阴窗台)\n\n月季光照:\n- item-13c3e3ea6eff (操作记录 半阴窗台)\n- item-12ade2b2e5e1 (条件与原理 通风露台)\n\n黄叶排查:\n- item-33e034f08c2b (操作记录 通风露台)\n- item-52c619201ab3 (条件与原理 通风露台)\n\nThis gives a balanced set of 20 candidates across all 10 topics, using practical care content types (操作记录 and 条件与原理), all directly relevant to home plant care and growth principles.\n\nLet me verify all these candidates are in the working set. Yes, all are present.\n\nLet me confirm none are 市场观察 or 专题观察. Correct, all are 操作记录 or 条件与原理.\n\nLet me publish these 20 with grounded reasons.\n\nLet me create the plan and publish.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether to include some 概念速览 for variety. The task says \"balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types.\" All candidates are from the same source (Open Web) and same interest. Content type balance is a consideration. But given the interest is about practical care, I've chosen operation records and conditions/principles which are most directly relevant. I could include a couple of concept overviews for variety. But the selection is already balanced across topics. I think it's fine to include a mix. Let me keep my selection but perhaps swap a couple to include concept overviews for content-type diversity.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The instruction says \"balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types.\" Since all are same source and interest, content type diversity matters. Let me include a mix of 操作记录, 条件与原理, and 概念速览.\n\nLet me revise to include some concept overviews. I'll do roughly: 8 操作记录, 6 条件与原理, 6 概念速览. Actually let me keep it balanced across topics with 2 each, mixing types.\n\nLet me finalize 20 with a good mix:\n\n草莓授粉:\n- item-002280b87be1 (操作记录 半阴窗台)\n- item-1325bfab77b8 (概念速览 夏季室内)\n\n盆土透气:\n- item-04bde6ad0003 (条件与原理 夏季室内)\n- item-3388cf0e679b (操作记录 夏季室内)\n\n香草扦插:\n- item-160347be1b39 (操作记录 朝南阳台)\n- item-0ee4229d4c27 (概念速览 夏季室内)\n\n蓝莓基质:\n- item-02afa433233c (操作记录 朝南阳台)\n- item-45fb6da94e7d (条件与原理 半阴窗台)\n\n薄荷修剪:\n- item-0203081e5c85 (操作记录 通风露台)\n- item-44d2953a9dd1 (条件与原理 朝南阳台)\n\n盆栽越冬:\n- item-26e02f642b93 (操作记录 朝南阳台)\n- item-1cb3d12a82fc (条件与原理 通风露台)\n\n番茄育苗:\n- item-309258e8bc8e (操作记录 朝南阳台)\n- item-53be14d6d282 (条件与原理 通风露台)\n\n多肉浇水:\n- item-096aa2f3c184 (操作记录 夏季室内)\n- item-0ee7c59bda70 (条件与原理 半阴窗台)\n\n月季光照:\n- item-13c3e3ea6eff (操作记录 半阴窗台)\n- item-12ade2b2e5e1 (条件与原理 通风露台)\n\n黄叶排查:\n- item-33e034f08c2b (操作记录 通风露台)\n- item-52c619201ab3 (条件与原理 通风露台)\n\nThis is 20 candidates, balanced across all 10 topics, with a mix of operation records and conditions/principles. Good.\n\nLet me publish.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"items":[{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-002280b87be1","recommendationReason":"草莓授粉在半阴窗台场景下的操作记录，直接对应阳台园艺中家庭植物养护的实际操作需求，适合作为入门实践参考。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-1325bfab77b8","recommendationReason":"草莓授粉在夏季室内场景的概念速览，帮助梳理授粉相关概念与可能现象，为家庭种植草莓提供问题目录。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-04bde6ad0003","recommendationReason":"盆土透气在夏季室内的条件与原理，解释光照、水分与根系状态对生长的影响，契合对生长原理的关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-3388cf0e679b","recommendationReason":"盆土透气在夏季室内的操作记录，给出处理顺序与复查时间，是家庭盆栽养护中可直接参考的实践内容。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-160347be1b39","recommendationReason":"香草扦插在朝南阳台的操作记录，覆盖扦插处理与补救方法，贴合阳台种植香草的家庭养护需求。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-0ee4229d4c27","recommendationReason":"香草扦插在夏季室内的概念速览，为家庭阳台香草繁殖提供概念梳理与现象说明。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-02afa433233c","recommendationReason":"蓝莓基质在朝南阳台的操作记录，涉及基质状态观察与处理顺序，契合家庭种植蓝莓的基质管理需求。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-45fb6da94e7d","recommendationReason":"蓝莓基质在半阴窗台的条件与原理，解释光照水分对根系的影响，帮助理解蓝莓基质管理的生长原理。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-0203081e5c85","recommendationReason":"薄荷修剪在通风露台的操作记录，给出修剪顺序与过度修剪补救，是家庭阳台香草养护的实用参考。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-44d2953a9dd1","recommendationReason":"薄荷修剪在朝南阳台的条件与原理，说明光照水分对修剪后生长的影响，契合对养护原理的理解需求。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-26e02f642b93","recommendationReason":"盆栽越冬在朝南阳台的操作记录，覆盖越冬处理顺序与复查，帮助家庭盆栽安全度过季节转换。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-1cb3d12a82fc","recommendationReason":"盆栽越冬在通风露台的条件与原理，解释温度通风